    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_AboutCapabilities">Controller Session Manager identifies connected controllers, preserves custom names and icons, reports trustworthy battery states, detects the controllers actually used by a game, and protects single-player or local multiplayer sessions when a participant disconnects.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_AboutSafety">Its external overlay and optional pause actions are isolated from Playnite and the game. It avoids input injection and falls back conservatively whenever device, process or online-session evidence is incomplete.</sys:String>
